  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Sustainable Public Transportation in Rabat, Morocco</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Electric Bus Support (9 million USD): Support for the operation plan of electric buses and provision of a total of 20 electric buses for two bus routes (L25, L30), support for electric bus charging facilities, 2. Eco-friendly Traffic Policy Promotion Activities (1.5 million USD): Delivery and installation of equipment related to promotional activities, implementation of promotional activities, and support for the production of promotional content, 3. Capacity Building and PMC Experts Dispatch (960,000 USD): Project management, dispatch of experts, capacity building related to public transportation and electric buses, 4. Project Management Costs (1.54 million USD): Logistics costs, performance management costs, M&amp;amp;E (Monitoring &amp;amp; Evaluation), contingency funds, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to carbon emission reduction by providing eco-friendly electric buses, and Enhancing public transportation usage through the promotion of eco-friendly transportation policies in Rabat, Morocco&#xce5c;&#xd658;&#xacbd; &#xc804;&#xae30;&#xbc84;&#xc2a4; &#xb3c4;&#xc785;&#xc5d0; &#xc758;&#xd55c; &#xc628;&#xc2e4;&#xac00;&#xc2a4; &#xbc30;&#xcd9c; &#xc800;&#xac10;, &#xce5c;&#xd658;&#xacbd; &#xc804;&#xae30;&#xbc84;&#xc2a4; &#xb300;&#xc911;&#xad50;&#xd1b5; &#xc774;&#xc6a9; &#xc99d;&#xb300;</narrative>
